      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arthur%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Electricity reached Arthur in 1926, while the rest of the county didn’t get power until the early 1950s.",
